Package: knhanesget
Title: 安装和更新 knhanes
Version: 0.1.0.7
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Heng", family = "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lh1399780@163.com")
Description: Provides a lightweight public installer for knhanes. It registers
    a locally generated Ed25519 and Curve25519 device identity, obtains
    administrator-approved short-lived download sessions from the official
    authorization server, decrypts device-bound activation envelopes, verifies
    versioned release archives, and supports activation, version checks,
    updates, and local deactivation. It contains no KNHANES data, knhanes
    analysis code, long-lived server credential, or server signing key.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
